: help
:
$* --help >~'/usage: .+mailmap \[<options>\]/'

: version
:
$* --version >~'/mailmap \d+\.\d+\.\d+.*/'

: no-arguments
: A command line with nothing to do is an error that shows the usage.
:
$* 2>~'/error: usage: .+mailmap \[<options>\]/' != 0

: unknown-option
: An option that is not recognized is named in the diagnostic.
:
$* --frobnicate 2>"error: unknown option '--frobnicate'" != 0

: unexpected-argument
: A positional argument is not accepted.
:
$* foo 2>"error: unexpected argument 'foo'" != 0
